  "notes": "Identity card, verbatim identifier tables, telemetry ban and the R-54 stand-down protocol with positive gating key and a light startup activation. Anchor for lib-identifiers and lib-standdown shared across the family. Name and id tables belong in generated data. Proposals tunnels and contribViewsWelcome are grants in the reference product configuration; the 1.5.3 manifest requests only resolvers.",
